   "data": {
    "text": "VOICE: sound 15\nEvery trigger comes from\nRhythm: SOUNDS TRIG,\nchannel 15 (Split).\n\nRandom: a new voltage on\neach trigger.\n8vert: down to ±1 V, two\noctaves.\nQuantizer: A minor (the\nVCO's tuning is A).\nVCO: the saw."
   }
